The party descended into a great hall filled with undead warriors. They fought through the dead and faced the lich guarding the Ember Void blades.
Lich: I once tried to destroy the armor. The gods condemned me to guard it.
Renia: Then your watch is over.
The lich warned that the armor would consume her. Renia refused to listen.
